---
import GuideLayout from '../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---
<GuideLayout title="MW4 on Steam" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p>本页说明如何在 <strong>Steam</strong>（及其他官方列出的平台入口）获取 MW4，并指向 Early Access 相关说明。</p>
    <p>价格、折扣、地区锁与 SKU <strong>一律以商店页实时展示为准</strong>；本站<strong>不写价格</strong>、<strong>不单独编造/展示 Steam AppID 数字栏</strong>（仅外链商店页）。</p>
  </div>
  <ol slot="how-to">
    <li>按下表选平台 → 跳官方或商店页。</li>
    <li>EA 资格与内容边界 → <a href="/early-access-mw4/">/early-access-mw4/</a>。</li>
    <li>发售时间线 → <a href="/mw4-release/">/mw4-release/</a>；回导览 <a href="/dmz-mw4/">/dmz-mw4/</a>。</li>
  </ol>
  <div slot="body">
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>平台与购买入口</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">How to get MW4</th><th scope="col">Notes</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Last verified</th><th scope="col">Sources</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Steam</td><td>打开 <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4435490/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_4/">Steam 上的 Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 商店页</a></td><td>Activision 明确列出 Steam 为 PC 预购渠道之一；价格以商店为准；<strong>不</strong>在站内写 AppID/价格栏</td><td>confirmed（入口存在 + 官方列名 Steam）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-7">[7]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Battle.net</td><td>经 Blizzard / Call of Duty PC 商店预购（以官方购买区为准）</td><td>与 Steam 同属官方列出的 PC 渠道</td><td>confirmed（渠道列名）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>PlayStation 5</td><td>平台商店预购（以 PS Store 为准）</td><td>官方 Editions 文列出</td><td>confirmed（渠道列名）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Xbox Series X|S / Xbox on PC</td><td>Xbox / Microsoft Store 预购</td><td>官方列出；含 Play Anywhere 说明见 Support 文</td><td>confirmed（渠道列名）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-6">[6]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Nintendo Switch 2</td><td>平台商店预购（以官方/商店为准）</td><td>官方列出</td><td>confirmed（渠道列名）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>官方汇入口</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/modernwarfare4/dmz">callofduty.com · MW4 DMZ</a> 购买/平台区</td><td>以页上购买区为准</td><td>confirmed</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-1">[1]</a></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h3>FAQ</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>Steam / 平台购买 FAQ</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Q</th><th scope="col">A</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Last verified</th><th scope="col">Sources</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Can I get MW4 on Steam?</td><td>可以。Activision Editions 文写明 PC 玩家可在 <strong>Battle.net 与 Steam</strong> 预购；商店页外链见上表。</td><td>confirmed</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-7">[7]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Does Steam purchase include Early Access?</td><td>官方：数字预购/预购 <strong>Standard Digital Edition 或 Vault Edition</strong> 含 Campaign EA（自 Oct 16）与 DMZ EA（自 Oct 20），并列出平台含 <strong>Steam</strong>。具体 SKU 以商店页为准。</td><td>confirmed</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-3">[3]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Will this page list prices?</td><td>否。价格易变，请以商店页为准。</td><td>confirmed（站内策略）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>—</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Will this page list a Steam AppID field?</td><td>否。本站不设 AppID 数字栏；需要购买时直接打开上方 Steam 商店外链。</td><td>confirmed（站内策略）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>—</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div slot="sources" class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <caption>Sources · 来源与更新日期</caption>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Notes</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr id="source-1"><td>1</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/modernwarfare4/dmz">Official MW4 DMZ</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>官方购买/平台汇入口</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-dmz-how-to-play-forward-operating-base-guide">DMZ Deep Dive Part 2: FOB Full Intel Guide</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>数字预购资格、EA 日历与平台列表；时区/停机可能变动</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-3"><td>3</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-campaign-early-access-live-now">Campaign Early Access Now Live</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>Campaign EA 与数字版平台列表（含 Steam）</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-5"><td>5</td><td><a href="https://support.activision.com/modern-warfare-4/articles/modern-warfare-4-editions">Activision Support · MW4 Editions</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>PC 渠道 Battle.net 与 Steam；官方平台列表及数字版 EA 权益</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-6"><td>6</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-intel-modern-warfare-4-launch-xbox-game-pass">COD Intel · Launch / Game Pass</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>Xbox / Game Pass 发售说明</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-7"><td>7</td><td><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4435490/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_4/">Steam · Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 商店页</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>仅作购买入口外链；价格与地区 SKU 以商店页为准</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
